    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but a \"small break\" doesn't change the fact that the machine just keeps turning. it doesn't matter if i take a walk or read a book, i still have to go back to being that... that nothingness. it feels like there's no way to actually win against it. the only way to actually stop the machine is to stop being a part of it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
